    "The background daemon is still starting. Reopen kinhin in a minute." : {
      "comment" : "Status line when the daemon hasn't answered after a wait; no in-process engine is started",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El daemon en segundo plano aún se está iniciando. Vuelve a abrir kinhin en un minuto."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バックグラウンドデーモンはまだ起動中です。1 分後に kinhin を開き直してください。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Hintergrund-Daemon startet noch. Öffne kinhin in einer Minute erneut."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ה-daemon ברקע עדיין מתחיל. פתחו את kinhin שוב בעוד דקה."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يزال daemon الخلفية قيد البدء. أعد فتح kinhin بعد دقيقة."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il daemon in background si sta ancora avviando. Riaprire kinhin tra un minuto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le daemon en arrière-plan démarre encore. Rouvrez kinhin dans une minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The benchmark creates temporary VMs and containers and removes them when it ends." : {
      "comment" : "Benchmarks confirmation body",
