    "the daemon LaunchAgent is installed but its binary is missing — run `kinhin daemon uninstall` to remove it" : {
      "comment" : "Warning shown under the fleet status; the backticked command must stay verbatim",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "el LaunchAgent del daemon está instalado, pero falta su binario: ejecuta `kinhin daemon uninstall` para quitarlo"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "デーモンの LaunchAgent はインストールされていますが、バイナリがありません — `kinhin daemon uninstall` を実行して削除してください"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "der Daemon-LaunchAgent ist installiert, aber seine Binärdatei fehlt – führe `kinhin daemon uninstall` aus, um ihn zu entfernen"
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ה-LaunchAgent של ה-daemon מותקן אך הקובץ הבינארי שלו חסר — הריצו `kinhin daemon uninstall` כדי להסיר אותו"
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تم تثبيت LaunchAgent لـ daemon لكن ملفه التنفيذي مفقود — شغّل `kinhin daemon uninstall` لإزالته"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "il LaunchAgent del daemon è installato ma il suo eseguibile manca — eseguire `kinhin daemon uninstall` per rimuoverlo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "le LaunchAgent du daemon est installé mais son binaire est introuvable — exécutez `kinhin daemon uninstall` pour le retirer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The default pool also keeps whatever share the others leave (Advanced → Capacity)." : {
